   - Treat extension_regularity as a *declared class axis* and check it matches the class token (F1 none, F2a C2, F2b C0) — a binding check, not an identity check.
   - Everything else: editorial.
   
2. X4 "absent paths" FAIL: absent paths across different classes are expected (class-specific fields). Fix: report absent paths as informational, not FAIL, except for the shared-core paths (which must be present in all three).

